o reference available, and web_search is allowed but the task says use tools. Actually I could web_search for SMB disassembly, but \"No reference is available\" and the instruction says use read_memory, disassemble, trace_writes, search_memory. It says no reference is available — meaning lookup_symbol has none. But web search could help. However, the spirit is to discover via emulator. I'll primarily use emulator, ma","truncated":true}
